{"2567880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gloves On!", "steam_appid": 2567880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<strong><i>Gloves On!</i></strong> is a boxing experience with realistic controls and a unique perspective of fighting games. Step in the ring with a fighter created by you or chosen between multiple options and fight a full match of boxing packed with adrenaline and action.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567880/extras/d1cc31987a44cb8c39d254859e12c0a2.poster.avif?t=1711306979\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567880/extras/d1cc31987a44cb8c39d254859e12c0a2.webm?t=1711306979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567880/extras/d1cc31987a44cb8c39d254859e12c0a2.mp4?t=1711306979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Simple and straight to the point, the first official game release of <strong><i>Deep Cave Studios</i></strong> is not messing around and will push you to the limit. Practice and learn the boxing fundamentals with real and accurate movements and techniques. Fight against fighters controlled by CPU or by a real person with Local or Online PvP or practice your punches against the punching bag.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Realistic Controls</strong> - Dynamic and Immersive controls to master<br></li><li> <strong>Training</strong> - Step into the Gloves On! Gym and master all the movements required to be a real fighter<br></li><li> <strong>Character Customization</strong> - Choose your equipment between 15+ types of shorts, gloves and headgear.<br></li><li> <strong>Local or Online PvP</strong> - Fight against people from all over the world or by connecting an extra controller<br>